                                                "text": "May Your Majeſty be pleaſed to accept theſe remains of a noble Author, as they vvere collected by the care of Your late Hiſtoriographer; […]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "29661c0e-52e3-4958-986d-8ea905cd1d85",
